# Tailwind v4 class syntax

This app uses **Tailwind CSS v4**. Prefer the current utility names the IDE/linter suggests. Do not invent arbitrary `[…]` values when a scale token exists.

## Opacity (0–100)

`/[0.03]` is 3% — write `/3`. Same for `/4`, `/10`, `/60`.

```txt
❌ ring-1 ring-foreground/[0.03]
✅ ring-1 ring-foreground/3

❌ bg-black/[0.1]
✅ bg-black/10
```

## Gradients

```txt
❌ bg-gradient-to-br from-muted/20
✅ bg-linear-to-br from-muted/20
```

(`to-r` / `to-b` / `to-t` / `to-br` stay; only the `bg-gradient-` prefix changes.)

## z-index

```txt
❌ z-[90]  z-[100]
✅ z-90    z-100
```

## When `[…]` is OK

Keep arbitrary values with **no token**: `rounded-[1.75rem]`, `max-w-[calc(100%-2rem)]`, `bg-[radial-gradient(…)]`.
